    given-names: Sen
    alias: zsenarchitect
    website: https://github.com/zsenarchitect
repository-code: https://github.com/LakeHouse-LLP/Template-OpenSource
url: https://github.com/LakeHouse-LLP/Template-OpenSource
license: pending
# Suggested license once finalized: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - template
  - open-source
  - lakehouse-llp
abstract: >-
  Public GitHub template for LakeHouse-LLP open-source projects. Provides
  OpenSSF-aligned defaults, README generation, changelog policy, secret
  scanning, and CI guards for zero-cost GitHub Free usage.
